     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Update on Git workshop<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: Carl G Stahmer &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">csta...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>Date: Thu, Jan 19, 2017 at 10:43 AM<br>Subject: [dsiaffiliates] Reschedule of first text mining workshop<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dsiaff...@ucdavis.edu</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dsiaff...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\nDear affiliates.  Earlier we sent out an announcement of a series of workshops here in the DSI.  We’ve just learned of a university-wide walkout scheduled for Friday, and we’ve heard from many graduate students and faculty that they will walkout.  As such,\r\n we are rescheduling the first workshop “Minimal Git” to 10:30 - 12:00 on February 3, immediately before the one already scheduled for that day. People can see the revised schedule at <a href=\"http://www.digitalscholarslab.org/2017/01/17/spring-workshop-schedule/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.digitalscholarslab.org/2017/01/17/spring-workshop-schedule/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467081982000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01BQTJSv7Rw4gMt-oD5_0r\">http://www.digitalscholarslab.org/2017/01/17/spring-workshop-schedule/</a>.\r\n  Sorry for the misstep.<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br>\r\n—</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Carl G. Stahmer, PhD</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Director of Digital Scholarship</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Library of the University of California, Davis</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Associate Director for Humanities</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">UC Davis Data Science Initiative</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">csta...@ucdavis.edu</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\r\n<a href=\"tel:(530)%20752-1138\" value=\"+15307521138\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">530-752-1138</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;line-height:normal\">\r\n<br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spa